<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">把一顿饭，变成小期待</view><view class="title">关于鱿鱼须须</view><view class="muted">版本 {{version}} · Squiddy</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="note">{{error}}</view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">现在这些，都可以免费用</view><view class="paragraph">创建私有厨房、邀请朋友、收藏菜谱、记录做法、点菜、推荐菜单、制作进度和数据导出。</view><view class="muted">每人最多加入5个厨房；每厨房80道菜、40场饭局，每场最多30道菜。内部参考价仅供厨师记录，不收款。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">厨房里的积累</view><view class="form-row"><text>菜谱</text><text>{{stats.dishes}} 道</text></view><view class="form-row"><text>可查看的饭局</text><text>{{stats.meals}} 顿</text></view><view class="muted">这是当前厨房的真实记录，没有可兑换积分或推广佣金。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">消息与提醒</view><view class="muted">{{notify?'在每场饭局内主动订阅提醒；可以在微信设置中调整权限。':'微信通知模板准备中，先在下方查看饭局动态。'}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="settings">检查微信订阅设置</button><view wx:if="{{local}}" class="muted">演练不会发送微信消息。</view></view><view class="section-title">最近饭局动态</view><view wx:if="{{!updates.length}}" class="empty">有了第一顿饭，这里就会留下动态。</view><view class="list-row" wx:for="{{updates}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="flex"><view class="dish-name">{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.when}} · {{item.label}}</view></view><text class="chevron">›</text></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="feedback">反馈问题或联系开发者</button></view>
